        "POST /index.php/apps/hot_tracks/admin/strava  hot_tracks.admin.savestrava  appinfo/routes.php:5 routes"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "Nothing in the app calls 3 routes outside OCS. Looked for: a route name or a path in the PHP source and the templates, in 9 files of the frontend source and in the navigation of info.xml. A route stays behind when the frontend stops calling it. A route that only a client outside the app calls shows here as well.",
        "  POST /index.php/apps/hot_tracks/api/disconnect  hot_tracks.api.disconnect  appinfo/routes.php:5 routes",
        "  GET /index.php/apps/hot_tracks/api/activities/{activityId}  hot_tracks.api.activity  appinfo/routes.php:5 routes",
        "  POST /index.php/apps/hot_tracks/admin/strava  hot_tracks.admin.savestrava  appinfo/routes.php:5 routes"
      ]
